            "review_text": "Glenn F\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent Dining Experience\nAug 2025 • Family\nThis is very nicely decorated with a high-end feel, but easy on your wallet. The main reason for my 5 star rating is the food. You will experience unique flavors & dishes that are not easy to find elsewhere. The quality of how the kitchen prepares its meals is high. I love the food as an American and I will be back. I highly recommend visiting when in HCM City.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 24, 2025",
