            "review_text": "Cian Pan\n8 contributions\n0\nGreat Vietnamese Cuisine Restaurant\nMay 2025 • Family\nPlaced at a quiet place with really chill space. They are serving Vietnamese traditional food. It is a best place to explore the authentic cuisine.\nTheir lovely staffs are well trained to show us how to enjoy the meal like local.\nTruly worthy experience\nInsider tip:\nYou should try those fish claypot dishes, really good.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 22, 2025",
